## 4. PixiEngine (Core Engine)

**File:** `src/lib/pixi-engine/core/PixiEngine.ts`

### Purpose
Orchestrates all engine subsystems and manages the game lifecycle.

### Dependencies
- **Input:** `GameConfig`, `GameFactory`
- **Output:** Fully initialized engine with game running

### Initialization Sequence

#### Phase 1: Core Infrastructure
```typescript
// 1. Initialize PixiApplication (canvas, renderer)
await this.app.init();

// 2. Initialize PixiJS Assets system
await Assets.init({ basePath, manifest });

// 3. Start background asset bundle loading
bundleLoadPromise = Promise.all(bundleNames.map(name => 
  Assets.loadBundle(name)
));
```

#### Phase 2: Manager Initialization
```typescript
// Core managers (no config dependency)
this.eventBus = new EventBus();
this.storageManager = new StorageManager();
this.gameStateManager = new GameStateManager(this.eventBus);
this.timerManager = new TimerManager(this.eventBus, this.storageManager);
this.controlsManager = new ControlsManager();
this.scoringManager = new ScoringManager(this.eventBus, this.storageManager);

// Config-dependent managers
this.controlsManager.init(this.config.controls, this.eventBus);
this.scoringManager.init(this.config.teams, this.config.gameMode);
this.powerUpManager = new PowerUpManager(this.eventBus, this.config);

// AudioManager with theme and config
this.audioManager = new AudioManager(
  this.eventBus, 
  this.storageManager, 
  themeConfig.soundsBasePath,
  this.config.initialMusicMuted,
  this.config.initialSfxMuted
);

// RuleEngine (depends on all other managers)
this.ruleEngine = new RuleEngine(this.eventBus, this.config, {
  timerManager: this.timerManager,
  gameStateManager: this.gameStateManager,
  scoringManager: this.scoringManager,
  powerUpManager: this.powerUpManager,
  audioManager: this.audioManager
});
```

#### Phase 3: Game Creation
```typescript
// Emit ready signal
this.eventBus.emit(ENGINE_EVENTS.ENGINE_READY_FOR_GAME);

// Create game instance
const managers = this.getAllManagers();
this.currentGame = gameFactory(this.config, managers);
this.app.getStage().addChild(this.currentGame.view);

// Initialize game (waits for assets)
await this.currentGame.init(bundleLoadPromise);

// Start update loop
ticker.add(this.handleUpdate);
```

### Manager Dependencies
- **EventBus:** Central communication hub
- **StorageManager:** Persistent data storage
- **GameStateManager:** Game state tracking
- **TimerManager:** Game timers
- **ControlsManager:** Input handling
- **ScoringManager:** Score tracking
- **PowerUpManager:** Power-up logic
- **AudioManager:** Sound playback
- **RuleEngine:** Event-driven game rules

